cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MeCoBi in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "MeCoBi: Metal Complex Builder"
abstract: >-
  MeCoBi turns SMILES strings of metal-complex ligands into optimised 3D
  structures of the assembled complex, covering donor and denticity perception,
  coordination number and geometry assignment, isomer enumeration, assembly and
  semi-empirical relaxation.
type: software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-11-06"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TheFreiLab/MeCoBi"
keywords:
  - chemistry
  - metal complex
  - coordination chemistry
  - structure generation
  - cheminformatics
